  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Livelihoods and Socio-Economic Integration of Vulnerable Groups in Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s proposed development objective is to improve livelihoods opportunities and social infrastructure in the city of Vahdat for refugees and host communities to promote social cohesion. The project intends to achieve the development objective by: (a) providing tools and equipment to 300 beneficiaries (50 percent refugeescomma 50 percent females) that successfully completed business and entrepreneurship trainings provided by UNHCR and (b) supporting upgrade of local infrastructure and services to promote social cohesion between refugees and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
